<title>USA: NY cert cotton stocks fall 1,805 bales to 104,392.</title>
<headline>NY cert cotton stocks fall 1,805 bales to 104,392.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of July 29 totaled 104,392 bales, down from 106,197 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were no bales awaiting review, two bales issued, 1,807 cancellations, and 1,610 decertification orders.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
